{"sections":[{"title":"Executive committee period and the election","about":"The election fills the seats of a committee period, so the period comes first. Both are made through the API because the run needs their ids.","entries":[{"kind":"api","actor":"Shalin Rahman","title":"Committee period created","detail":"Executive Committee, 2026-11-25 to 2028-11-25. Periods may not overlap, so it starts after the last one on record.","ok":true,"n":1},{"kind":"api","actor":"Shalin Rahman","title":"Election created","detail":"Election 31 in the Announced phase.","ok":true,"table":{"head":["Seat","Places","Seat id"],"rows":[["President",1,87],["General Secretary",1,88],["Treasurer",1,89]]},"n":2},{"kind":"web","actor":"Shalin Rahman (Administrator)","title":"The new election on the admin elections page","detail":"No ballot key yet, so the card says voting cannot open.","shot":"003.png","ok":true,"n":3}]},{"title":"Voter roll and officials","about":"The roll is frozen so the electorate is fixed. Officials are appointed by persona; each one has to accept before they can act.","entries":[{"kind":"web","actor":"Shalin Rahman (Administrator)","title":"Voter roll frozen","detail":"The toast gives the number of voters on the roll.","shot":"004.png","ok":true,"n":4},{"kind":"web","actor":"Shalin Rahman (Administrator)","title":"Appointing Md. Shamsul Islam as Returning Officer","shot":"005.png","ok":true,"n":5},{"kind":"web","actor":"Shalin Rahman (Administrator)","title":"Appointing MD. IQBAL HOSSAIN BHUIYAN as Chief Commissioner","shot":"006.png","ok":true,"n":6},{"kind":"web","actor":"Shalin Rahman (Administrator)","title":"Appointing AMENA KHATUN as Commissioner","shot":"007.png","ok":true,"n":7},{"kind":"web","actor":"Shalin Rahman (Administrator)","title":"Appointing Abdul Ahad as Appeal Tribunal Member","shot":"008.png","ok":true,"n":8},{"kind":"web","actor":"Shalin Rahman (Administrator)","title":"Appointing Israt Jahan Najnin as Scrutineer","shot":"009.png","ok":true,"n":9},{