":"The election is in the Announced phase.","shot":"031.png","ok":true,"n":31},{"kind":"web","actor":"MD. IQBAL HOSSAIN BHUIYAN (Chief Commissioner)","title":"Publish requested","shot":"032.png","ok":true,"n":32},{"kind":"web","actor":"AMENA KHATUN (Commissioner)","title":"Publish: waiting for a second person","detail":"The request shows on the dashboard of an official who can approve it.","shot":"033.png","ok":true,"n":33},{"kind":"web","actor":"AMENA KHATUN (Commissioner)","title":"Publish: approved","shot":"034.png","ok":true,"n":34},{"kind":"web","actor":"Public visitor","title":"The public elections page after publishing","shot":"035.png","ok":true,"n":35}]},{"title":"Nominations","about":"Each proposer files a nomination on the member election page, naming the candidate and a seconder.","entries":[{"kind":"web","actor":"Hritam Raj Mukherjee (Proposer)","title":"Hritam Raj Mukherjee nominates Roksana Parvin for President","detail":"Sabina yasmin seconds.","shot":"036.png","ok":true,"n":36},{"kind":"web","actor":"Hritam Raj Mukherjee (Proposer)","title":"Nomination for Roksana Parvin filed","shot":"037.png","ok":true,"n":37},{"kind":"web","actor":"SHEIKH ABDUL BAKIR (Proposer)","title":"SHEIKH ABDUL BAKIR nominates ADVOCATE MUJIBUR RAHMAN for President","detail":"Md. Mahabub-Ur-Reza seconds.","shot":"038.png","ok":true,"n":38},{"kind":"web","actor":"SHEIKH ABDUL BAKIR (Proposer)","title":"Nomination for ADVOCATE MUJIBUR RAHMAN filed","shot":"039.png","ok":true,"n":39},{"kind":"web","actor":"Md Habibur Rahman (Shalin) (Proposer)","title":"Md Habibur Rahman (Shalin) nominates MD GOLZER HOSSAIN for General Secretary","detail":"Subrata das seconds.","shot":"040.png","ok":true,"n":40},{"kind":"web","actor":"Md Habibur Rahman (Shalin) (Proposer)","title":"Nomination for MD GOLZER HOSSAIN filed","shot":"041.png","ok":true,"n":41},{"kind":"web","actor":"Professor Abu Ahmed Ahsan Kabir (Proposer)","title":"Professor Abu Ahmed Ahsan Kabir nominates Rajkumari Mukherjee for General Secretary","detail":"Utpal Das seconds.","shot":"042.png","ok":true,"n":42},{"kind":"web","actor":"Professor Abu Ahmed Ahsan Kabir (Proposer)","title":"Nomination for Rajkumari Mukherjee filed","shot":"043.png","ok":true,"n":43},{"kind":"web","actor":"Md Alauddin (Proposer)","title":"Md Alauddin nominates MD Alamgir Kabir for General Secretary","detail":"Professor Nazmun Nahar seconds.","shot":"044.png","ok":true,"n":44},{"kind":"web","actor":"Md Alauddin (Proposer)","title":"Nomination for MD Alamgir Kabir filed","shot":"045.png","ok":true,"n":45},{"kind":"web","actor":"Ad. Mahbub Ul Alam Sawpon (Proposer)","title":"Ad. Mahbub Ul Alam Sawpon nominates Kamrun Nahar for Treasurer","detail":"Mohammed Khalid Hossain seconds.","shot":"046.png","ok":true,"n":46},{"kind":"web","actor":"Ad. Mahbub Ul Alam Sawpon (Proposer)","title":"Nomination for Kamrun Nahar filed","shot":"047.png","ok":true,"n":47},{"kind":"web","actor":"SALMA BEGUM (Proposer)","title":"SALMA BEGUM nominates MD Anwar Hossain Gazi for Treasurer","detail":"Md. Jamal Milki seconds.","shot":"048.png","ok":true,"n":48},{"kind":"web","actor":"SALMA BEGUM (Proposer)","title":"Nomination for MD Anwar Hossain Gazi filed","shot":"049.png","ok":true,"n":49},{"kind":"check","actor":"Run","title":"Nominations on file","ok":true,"table":{"head":["Seat","Candidate","Proposer","Seconder","Nomination","Status"],"rows":[["President","Roksana Parvin","Hritam Raj Mukherjee","Sabina yasmin",122,"Submitted"],["President","ADVOCATE MUJIBUR RAHMAN","SHEIKH ABDUL BAKIR","Md. Mahabub-Ur-Reza",123,"Submitted"],["General Secretary","MD GOLZER HOSSAIN","Md Habibur Rahman (Shalin)","Subrata das",124,"Submitted"],["General Secretary","Rajkumari Mukherjee","Professor Abu Ahmed Ahsan Kabir","Utpal Das",125,"Submitted"],["General Secretary","MD Alamgir Kabir","Md Alauddin","Professor Nazmun Nahar",126,"Submitted"],["Treasurer","Kamrun Nahar","Ad. Mahbub Ul Alam Sawpon","Mohammed Khalid Hossain",127,"Submitted"],["Treasurer","MD