.png","ok":true,"n":96},{"kind":"web","actor":"Subrata das (Voter)","title":"The same member opens the ballot again","detail":"The page says the member has already voted.","shot":"097.png","ok":true,"n":97},{"kind":"web","actor":"Professor Abu Ahmed Ahsan Kabir (Voter)","title":"The ballot","detail":"Every accepted candidate with their statement. The withdrawn and rejected ones are not listed.","shot":"098.png","ok":true,"n":98},{"kind":"web","actor":"Professor Abu Ahmed Ahsan Kabir (Voter)","title":"Choices made","shot":"099.png","ok":true,"n":99},{"kind":"web","actor":"Professor Abu Ahmed Ahsan Kabir (Voter)","title":"Reviewing the ballot before casting","shot":"100.png","ok":true,"n":100},{"kind":"web","actor":"Professor Abu Ahmed Ahsan Kabir (Voter)","title":"Ballot recorded","detail":"Tracking code 1GQV-A8J0-P4BF.","shot":"101.png","ok":true,"n":101},{"kind":"web","actor":"Professor Abu Ahmed Ahsan Kabir (Voter)","title":"The same member opens the ballot again","detail":"The page says the member has already voted.","shot":"102.png","ok":true,"n":102},{"kind":"api","actor":"Voters","title":"Ballots cast","ok":true,"table":{"head":["Voter","Channel","Tracking code"],"rows":[["Md Habibur Rahman (Shalin)","web","ZBGX-J3H0-DNPF"],["Subrata das","web","XDQ9-1T17-DPZZ"],["Professor Abu Ahmed Ahsan Kabir","web","1GQV-A8J0-P4BF"],["Utpal Das","API","V0QN-8TNY-5GWN"],["Md Alauddin","API","2QT9-E1Z4-9KKD"],["Professor Nazmun Nahar","API","MQKT-PTTD-6P5N"],["Ad. Mahbub Ul Alam Sawpon","API","H74P-PY77-Q0G6"],["Mohammed Khalid Hossain","API","1YT5-165J-T1RT"],["SALMA BEGUM","API","DFPR-ZEJK-N0MH"],["Md. Jamal Milki","API","XPMZ-MJ22-C9ZW"],["Hritam Raj Mukherjee","API","GEEG-J489-98XC"],["Sabina yasmin","API","AP2W-822R-G0FB"],["SHEIKH ABDUL BAKIR","API","THPT-AWFK-TSPZ"],["Md. Mahabub-Ur-Reza","API","MH1E-5XY8-NW2T"]]},"n":103},{"kind":"refusal","actor":"Utpal Das","title":"A second ballot from the same member is refused","detail":"POST /elections/31/vote answered 409: You